OL,3,ABurnham rejects 'tax and spend
OL,4,Asocialist' comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has insisted he is
OL,7,Fprepared to take "difficult decisions"
OL,8,Fon the economy, after a former Bank of
OL,9,FEngland chief economist said investors
OL,10,Fwere worried about his willingness to
OL,11,Fcut spending.
OL,13,FAndy Haldane, who has advised Burnham
OL,14,Fon the economy, claimed financial
OL,15,Fmarkets had grown wary of his economic
OL,16,Fplans and now considered his
OL,17,Fpremiership a "traditional tax and
OL,18,Fspend socialist government".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,117,105,200,300,0,100
