OL,3,ABurnham rejects 'tax and spend
OL,4,Asocialist' comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the PM rejected this, adding that
OL,7,Fhe would not take risks with the
OL,8,Feconomy and had already made difficult
OL,9,Fchoices since taking office.
OL,11,FIt comes as recent rises to the cost of
OL,12,FUK borrowing worsened the political
OL,13,Foptions facing the government ahead of
OL,14,Fnext month's Budget.
